        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Build and deployment timing\nBuild duration is recorded in the exact-run release-qualification.json artifact; verified deployment duration belongs to the operator-observed deployment-observation.json receipt. These structured records include source SHA and image digest, contain no request/user dimensions, and are not deployment approval. They are kept as receipts rather than exported as process gauges because builds and deployments are external to the API process."
